    "text": "The enthalpy change for the conversion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;(g) to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>)</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> (Nearest integer)<br />Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mtext>dis&#160;</mtext></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>eg</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mi>Cl</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>350</mn><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>hyd</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msubsup><mi>Cl</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>380</mn><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
