  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>Cl</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>Cl</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>aq</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>-</mo></msubsup></math></p><p>Apply Hess&#39;s law,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>dis</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>eg</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mrow><mi>Cl</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>hyd</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><msubsup><mi>Cl</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>240</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>350</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><m